WEBVTT

00:12:57.606 --> 00:13:00.234
And while this is a sensitive topic,

00:13:00.275 --> 00:13:03.403
I can say that it's quite possible

00:13:03.445 --> 00:13:09.201
that construction on this new campus
might resume relatively soon.

00:13:09.785 --> 00:13:10.994
Time will tell.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:14.748
Nine years ago,

00:13:14.748 --> 00:13:17.459
I stood on a TEDWomen stage,

00:13:17.501 --> 00:13:24.049
and I said Afghanistan is a country
of hope and boundless possibilities.

00:13:24.091 --> 00:13:25.467
And every single day,

00:13:25.509 --> 00:13:27.719
the girls of SOLA remind me of that.

00:13:28.136 --> 00:13:30.430
Like me, they are dreaming big.